WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.300
I'm Otávio, from operations and team.

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.700
My job is to get you out of the day-to-day
without the company falling apart.

3
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.200
Before you hire or change the team,

4
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.000
I show who's holding things together
and where the process breaks.

5
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.500
The decision is yours.

6
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.900
When you need to step back from the day-to-day
safely, call me.
